sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant UI as Webview
    participant Shell as Rust shell
    participant Sup as Supervisor
    participant Rec as runtime.json
    participant Eng as brain agent
    UI->>Shell: invoke shell_status
    Note right of Shell: returns the full snapshot
    Shell->>Sup: read supervisor state
    Sup->>Rec: read port + token
    Note right of Rec: owner-only 0600 record
    Sup->>Eng: spawn --parent-pid
    Sup->>Eng: GET /v1/health every 2s
    UI->>Shell: api_request GET /v1/records
    Note right of Shell: re-reads token, adds Bearer
    Shell->>Eng: allowlisted path on loopback
    Note right of Eng: JSON body or SSE frames
    Note right of Shell: returns body only, no token
